      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;pie-poj---3122&#34;&gt;Pie (&lt;a href=&#34;https://vjudge.net/problem/POJ-3122&#34;&gt;POJ - 3122&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;题面&#34;&gt;题面&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My birthday is coming up and traditionally I&amp;rsquo;m serving pie. Not just one pie, no, I have a number N of them, of various tastes and of various  sizes. F of my friends are coming to my party and each of them gets a  piece of pie. This should be one piece of one pie, not several small  pieces since that looks messy. This piece can be one whole pie though.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
